# What builder/Dockerfile never reads, from the repository's root: what a build or an install wrote,
# and the history
.git
.claude
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/obj
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/TestResults
builder/.protoc
builder/.yarn/*
!builder/.yarn/releases
# what tools/fuzz.mjs at the root writes beside the blueprint's fuzz target, by hand
builder/tools/fuzz/corpus
builder/tools/fuzz/findings
builder/tools/fuzz/.build
builder/tools/fuzz/.yarn
